    - target: {fileID: 4437728759036122965, guid: d4941f5e9e1c0a04ca348fe19252aa41, type: 3}
      propertyPath: statement
      value: "2011 - You\u2019ve graduated high school and are ready to move out."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4437728759036122965, guid: d4941f5e9e1c0a04ca348fe19252aa41, type: 3}
      propertyPath: redOption.ButtonText
      value: Look for a job, I suppose. Save up some money. Maybe apply for a trade
        school.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4437728759036122965, guid: d4941f5e9e1c0a04ca348fe19252aa41, type: 3}
      propertyPath: blueOption.ButtonText
      value: College. But after that? I honestly have no idea.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4437728759036122965, guid: d4941f5e9e1c0a04ca348fe19252aa41, type: 3}
      propertyPath: yellowOption.ButtonText
      value: I want to travel! See new sights, meet new people...that sort of thing.
